&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI/Agent Engineering &lt;/strong&gt;that is essential to the enterprise agent strategy – MCP, RAG, embeddings/vector search, tool calling, agent architecture, evaluation, grounding, orchestration. Architect and govern the Enterprise Agentic AI Strategy, deploying multi-agent frameworks and LLM-powered tools at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and deploy enterprise-grade multi-agent AI systems for complex, multi-step workflows, integrating with ERP, CRM, and ITSM to automate high-value decisions end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design internal AI tools and agents (e.g., AI Finance Bot, domain-specific LLM applications) and lead the roadmap for next-generation agentic platforms as emerging capabilities mature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; AI Readiness&lt;/strong&gt; – quality, lineage, observability, catalog, access controls, PII, retention, AI data governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide business context to a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Semantic &amp;amp; Context Architecture&lt;/strong&gt; with metrics layer, business ontology, entity relationships, metadata, knowledge graphs/semantic models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale the team&lt;/strong&gt; – build, mentor, motivate and lead high-performance team across Data Engineering, Analytics Engineering and AI Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner collaboratively&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with business units, product teams, security, legal and compliance teams to deliver AI and data solutions that align to enterprise goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Anaplan beyond pipelines feeding dashboards into a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Data Architecture&lt;/strong&gt; environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;: Bachelor’s or Master’s degree, Computer Science, Data Engineering, AI/ML, Math or a highly quantitative field of study.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership experience&lt;/strong&gt; of 12+ years in data and software engineering environments, with at least 5 years in a senior manager or executive role leading cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;core technical stack&lt;/strong&gt; - cloud data ecosystems (eg. Snowflake, Databricks, Vertex AI, AWS Sagemaker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience moving to &lt;strong&gt;modern data architecture&lt;/strong&gt; environment, with Deep Datawarehouse/lakehouse (AWS Redshift, Databricks), streaming/batch, APIs, data products, ELT, CDC, structured + unstructured data experience.&lt;/li&gt;
