&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Customer Experience  Remote

(Senior) Teamlead GMV Analytics(w/m/d) &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://assets.wp.lanes-planes.com/app/uploads/2025/12/Posting-header-banner.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;styles-module__fieldItemName___s-uMO&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Love numbers? Want everything to run like a well-oiled machine without losing sight of the big picture? In this versatile role, you’ll not only own all analytics around our GMV reporting, but also play a key part in shaping the underlying processes and data flows. You’ll have plenty of room to actively build and develop an important area of Finance and to drive critical change. Working closely with Finance Leadership, you’ll lead your own team and help shape sustainable processes and automation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles-module__fieldItemName___s-uMO&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles-module__fieldItemName___s-uMO&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech infrastructure and process design:&lt;/strong&gt; You ensure a high-performance analytics infrastructure to manage our rapidly growing travel volume (GMV) reliably, efficiently and at scale. A large part of your work will focus on making existing workflows more efficient and acting as a driver for lasting change: designing and steering projects for continuous process improvement and targeted (AI) automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial steering &amp;amp; impact: &lt;/strong&gt;You take charge of steering and analyzing our entire GMV. Rather than just reporting, you analyze the numbers and derive concrete recommendations for action. To do this, you master our liquidity and risk KPIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business partnering: &lt;/strong&gt;You’re an important sparring partner for the Finance leadership and work closely and cross-functionally with Accounting, Treasury, Product, Supplier Management and other teams (e.g. Customer Care).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data quality &amp;amp; transparency: &lt;/strong&gt;You love accuracy and ensure consistently high data quality, so that all financial information is transparent and reliable. You love understanding exactly how data flows work and directing them where they create the most value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;You lead and develop a high-performing team specializing in revenue analysis, finance operations and analytics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You have at least &lt;strong&gt;five years of experience &lt;/strong&gt;in an &lt;strong&gt;analytical, process-driven field under your belt, ideally in finance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You love data. You don’t just read numbers; you can &lt;strong&gt;interpret&lt;/strong&gt; them, put them in context and &lt;strong&gt;translate them into concrete recommendations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You’ve already successfully demonstrated your &lt;strong&gt;leadership skills &lt;/strong&gt;and have previously worked as a team lead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You’re known for working with &lt;strong&gt;great precision&lt;/strong&gt; and have the drive to proactively push change within the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You &lt;strong&gt;spot problems early, structure them, abstract from individual cases&lt;/strong&gt; and develop sound solutions, which you document clearly, align with stakeholders and implement consistently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You proactively &lt;strong&gt;take ownership&lt;/strong&gt; and are excited to help build processes and structures from the ground up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You have experience with &lt;strong&gt;modern BI&lt;/strong&gt; and reporting tools (e.g. Power BI, Tableau or comparable solutions).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ideally, you have scripting and coding skills (Python, Google Apps Script) and are keen to apply AI and automation in a targeted way in finance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles-module__fieldItemName___s-uMO&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Your Benefits with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ready to step into the Lanes &amp;amp; Planes cockpit and take off as a &quot;Lanie&quot;? Here is what awaits you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible Work Models:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We offer hybrid work models or 100% remote options (depending on the role). This position is hybrid, based in Munich (50% in-office / 50% remote).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work remotely from other EU countries for up to 60 days per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you work 100% remotely, we provide ergonomic home office equipment (after your probation period).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will be provided with brand-new IT equipment, including a MacBook, keyboard, and mouse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Enjoy 28 days of paid vacation per year, increasing automatically at regular intervals (up to a maximum of 30 days).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Receive a 10% discount on personal travel booked via the L&amp;amp;P platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Get a DRV card offering discounts on numerous leisure activities (after your probation period).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Receive an additional €30 allowance toward a benefit of your choice:&lt;/span&gt; Deutschlandticket, Wellpass, Jobrad (bike leasing), capital-forming benefits (VL), or company pension scheme (after your probation period).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Else You Should Know:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We foster an open feedback culture. Among other initiatives, we hold two dedicated review sessions per year to exchange feedback and discuss your individual development opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Our teams go on a joint workation once a year to strengthen team spirit and enjoy time together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A modern office at Hirschgarten (directly on Munich&#39;s main S-Bahn line) with views of the Alps and the Munich skyline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Are you looking for an exciting new challenge? Are you a true team player? We offer you a fantastic opportunity to become part of our success story!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lanes &amp;amp; Planes is the first travel and expense management solution that seamlessly maps every aspect of a business trip digitally and end-to-end—from booking to accounting and beyond. A corporate travel platform that helps our clients save time, money, and hassle. Our team consists of talented, dedicated people with a passion for new technologies and a mission to make B2B travel simpler and more convenient.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns über deine Bewerbung bei Lanes &amp;amp; Planes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dein Lanes &amp;amp; Planes Talent Acquisition Team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Finance  München, Bavaria

